WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.667
1853. A table seems to move without anyone intending it.

00:00:06.667 --> 00:00:13.333
Some sitters say the table pulls their hands.

00:00:13.333 --> 00:00:20.000
Faraday builds a simple indicator to test which moves first.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.667
When the indicator is visible, unwanted movement diminishes.

00:00:26.667 --> 00:00:33.333
A force from the hands precedes movement of the table.

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:40.000
The motion is real. Feeling a cause is not proof of that cause.
